Introducing Soulpepper’s 2026/27 Academy!
 
We’re thrilled to welcome five talented artists to this year’s cohort: Noah Beemer, Jake Bunyan, Jasmine Case, Olivia Neary-Hatton and Anaka Maharaj-Sandhu. 
 
✨This season five talented artists will develop their craft alongside some of the country’s leading theatre-makers while becoming fully immersed in the artistic life of a major professional theatre company. 
 
Swipe to discover the next generation of Soulpepper artists and see them on stage this season in Spring Awakening & Parfumerie! 

Photos 📸 Ted Belton

